      "build a candidate snapshot outside the production runtime",
      "produce record-level and criterion-level diffs against the active snapshot",
      "review threshold crossings, evidence-direction changes and missing records",
      "run targeted regressions and the complete quality suite",
      "record expert approval and update source, manifest, tests and documentation together"
    ]
  },
